<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Dumbbell foreground icon — matches DumbbellIcon Canvas in SplashAnimScreen.kt exactly.

    Coordinate system: 108 × 108 viewport.
    The dumbbell is drawn in the 100 × 52 dp canvas (same proportions as the Compose
    DumbbellIcon composable called with Modifier.size(100.dp, 52.dp)), centred at (54, 54).
    Offset applied: x += 4, y += 28.

    Drawing order (back → front):
      1. Left inner plate   – white 60 % alpha
      2. Left outer plate   – white
      3. Left collar ring   – #FF6B35 accent
      4. Centre grip bar    – white (pill shape)
      5. Right collar ring  – #FF6B35 accent
      6. Right outer plate  – white
      7. Right inner plate  – white 60 % alpha
-->
